{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pirate Gamer has trapped you inside the Arcade Asylum with other gamers. Play through\u00a0a variety of reimagined classic minigames from diverse genres with varied graphics and unique twists. The catch? You have to be the best across all genres of games to beat out all the other inmates and escape the Asylum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Arcade Asylum&quot; is the perfect game for online parties, and competitive gamers who crave a blend of chaotic fun and strategic gameplay. Can you prove your skills and smarts to be the first to escape the Arcade Asylum, or will you become another mad denizen of this bizarre world? The Pirate Gamer awaits your attempt to escape!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW TO ESCAPE?</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324780/extras/aaf88261b067151b689573bba7a5214f.avif?t=1769831783\" width=341 height=97 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324780/extras/575ea0c57eac5670dea86fe63f87bd4c.poster.avif?t=1769831783\" width=116 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324780/extras/575ea0c57eac5670dea86fe63f87bd4c.webm?t=1769831783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW TO EARN TOKENS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.